cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "MCS-tracking: Mesoscale Convective System and convective storm tracker"
abstract: >-
  Tracker for mesoscale convective systems and convective storms in gridded
  precipitation and outgoing longwave radiation fields, adapted from the
  A. Prein MCS-tracking algorithm to ingest WRF output or any other netCDF
  input, packaged as the Python module mcstracking. Used for the EPICC
  western-Mediterranean convective-storm study; the evaluation and analysis
  scripts of that study are kept in a separate repository.
authors:
